-- testdata/fill: the width boundary, which is the only place an off-by-one
-- in the measurement shows up. This file is CANONICAL: `wokfmt` must
-- reproduce it byte for byte.
--
-- Application juxtaposition owns no separator, so this line CANNOT be
-- broken and stays long. The printer reports it rather than pretending.
module M

f = collect aaaaaaaaaa bbbbbbbbbb cccccccccc dddddddddd eeeeeeeeee ffffffffff gggg
